Architecture
<!-- Embed your "after" diagram here -->
![Network Diagram](docs/network-diagram-after.jpg)
Stack: OPNsense · VLANs · Python · React · Docker · SQLite/PostgreSQL
Skills Demonstrated
Network segmentation with VLANs and inter-VLAN routing
Firewall rule design (least-privilege between segments)
DHCP/DNS configuration per subnet
Full-stack monitoring application (Python backend, React dashboard)
Containerization with Docker / Docker Compose
Network troubleshooting and traffic verification (nmap, Wireshark)
Network Design
VLAN	Name	Subnet	Gateway	Purpose
1	Management	10.10.1.0/24	10.10.1.1	Switch and OPNsense admin
10	Trusted	10.10.10.0/24	10.10.10.1	Main lab machines
20	IoT	10.10.20.0/24	10.10.20.1	Untrusted devices
30	Lab	10.10.30.0/24	10.10.30.1	Experiments, test VMs
Full plan: `docs/ip-vlan-plan.md`
Firewall Policy Summary
Trusted → unrestricted outbound
IoT → internet only, blocked from all private (RFC1918) ranges
Lab → internet only <!-- update if you allow Lab -> Trusted -->
All VLANs → OPNsense only, for DNS/DHCP
